        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Deyemi Okanlawon, Falz\n- Works: Gidi Up, An African City, If Tomorrow Comes, Road to Yesterday, No be You, Soldier, The School Boys\n- Topics: Acting roles, Music career\n\nFacts:\n- Falz began his career in secondary school by forming a group called The School Boys with his friend.\n- Falz began his professional career as a music artist in 2009.\n- Deyemi Okanlawon is best known for his roles in the TV series Gidi Up and An African City.\n- Deyemi Okanlawon featured in the films If Tomorrow Comes and Road to Yesterday.\n- Deyemi Okanlawon made cameo appearances in Nigerian music videos including No be You by Waje and Soldier by Falz.",
